csrc/bindings.cu is a separate PyTorch/CUDA ownership adapter, replacing
main's TVM FFI binding. workspace.py replaces main's Python ownership and
preparation glue; fixed_config.py extracts the original R184 launch triples.
These adapter files are licensed under Apache-2.0 as marked in their headers.
No flashinfer Python modules are included or shadowed.

pcie-tune-free.json is the original dumped R184 file, unchanged. Its
max_numel=41943040 keys are NOT relabelled as measurements at max_numel=1638400.
Using these legal launch triples with the smaller slab is an explicit
performance assumption, described in ../NOTES21.md in the delivery directory.
